* T3 fixture: Program with multiple DDM references (READ, FIND, STORE, record UPDATE/DELETE)
* Exercises SymbolDDMReference children with named references and empty-Name skip

DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
  1 EMPLOYEE-VIEW
    2 EMP-ID (N5)
    2 EMP-NAME (A40)
END DEFINE

READ EMPLOYEE-VIEW

  STORE DEPARTMENT

  FIND LOCATION
    UPDATE
  END-FIND

END

END
